---Token use of a repo's merged trails of one size
---
---Peers are the repo's merged trails, each at its latest TCO version,
---with a current change size in the bucket, merged at or after since,
---minus trail. During a regeneration peers can mix TCO versions. A
---trail with no model rows is a peer with 0 tokens. without_cache_reads
---leaves out cache reads; cache writes stay in. Statistics are null,
---never omitted, when they cannot be computed. A parameter other than
---phase given twice, or a bracketed name, is invalid_request; other
---unlisted parameters are ignored. A project_id that is not a ULID gets
---the same 403 as a project the caller cannot view. Methods other than
